{"sourceUrl":"https://pharm.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgz/5376.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:50.235787+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://pharm.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgz/5376.html","html":"<div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  我院传承上海交通大学追求卓越的信念，重视一流专业人才的遴选和培养，即将启动2026级研究生夏令营活动，诚邀全国各地优秀学子报名加入，并鼓励同学们申请直博。本届夏令营活动拟于2025年7月采用线下方式进行，具体安排请关注学院官网后续通知。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>一、学院简介</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  上海交通大学药学院成立于2000年，以建设世界一流学科和一流药学院为奋斗目标，践行价值引领、知识探究、能力建设、人格养成“四位一体”人才培养理念，以本科教育为立院之本，以研究生教育和科学研究为强院之路，构建学科齐全、研究力量雄厚的学科发展体系，坚持教学和科研并重，培养基础知识扎实、专业知识面宽、综合素质高、具有国际视野和担当精神的研究型和创新型药学领域专业人才。药学院拥有完备的学科体系，在教育部第四轮学科评估中，药学学科进入A类学科， 2017年起进入国家“双一流”建设学科。目前，药理学和毒理学专业在US NEWS世界大学专业排名中位于第18位，QS学科排名第62名，ESI全球高校学科排名进入前1‰。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  学院拥有“创新免疫治疗”全国重点实验室、“细胞工程及抗体药物”教育部工程研究中心、“上海市药物靶标发现及递送”前沿科学研究基地、“上海市高校生物技术和抗体药物”重点实验室、“上海市手性药物分子工程”重点实验室、上海交大“新乡生物医药中心”等重要科研平台，承担了科技部“2030脑科学”重大研究计划、科技部“揭榜挂帅”项目、国家自然科学基金重点及原创探索项目、新基石项目、 “新药创制”国家重大专项等多项国家及省部级重大重点项目以及国内外横向合作项目。近年来，授权发明专利百余项，在Nat Microbiol、Sci Immunol、PNAS、Sci Adv、Nat Comm、J Exp Med、JACS、J Med Chem等国际知名期刊发表数百篇学术论文，多项科研成果成功实现转化。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>二、申请专业</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<div>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>申报类别</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学位类别</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>专业</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>研究方向/领域</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>硕士生</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学术型</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"4\">\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>药物化学</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>药理学</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>药剂学</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>微生物与生物技术药物学</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>药物分析学</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>生药学</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><b><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>智能药学</span></span></b></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>8.</span></span></span></b><b><span><span>临床药学（仅专业型）</span></span></b></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>专业型</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">\n<p><span><span><span><span>直博生</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>学术型</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>药学</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>专业型</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><span><span><span><span>药学/生物与医药</span></span></span></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>三、申请条件</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>拥护中国共产党，热爱祖国，品德优良，遵纪守法，身心健康。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>诚实守信，学风端正，无任何考试作弊、剽窃他人学术成果以及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>健康状况需符合教育部规定的研究生招考体检标准。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>纳入双一流建设的高校或学科、国家重点学科以及其它院校在校本科三年级优秀学生</span></span></span></span></span><span><span>（2026年夏季毕业）</span></span><span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>学习成绩优异，本科前三年（或前五学期）总评成绩排名在专业前30%。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>英语水平良好，全国大学英语六级成绩≥425分或TOEFL≥90分或IELTS≥6.0分。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span><span>对药学有浓厚的兴趣，并有志于药学专业领域深造，有较强的科研潜力。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>四、申请程序</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>报名时间：即日起至</span><i>7</i></span></span><span><span><span>月</span><i>3</i></span></span><span><span><span>日上午9:00</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>报名网址：</span></span></span> <u> </u><u><span><span><span>https://ga.sjtu.edu.cn/zsgl/xlygl/default.aspx</span></span></span></u></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>上海交通大学研究生院招生网-管理信息系统登录-考生登录-夏令营考生登录</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  填写夏令营申请信息，并按照研招网系统要求上传申请材料（<b>所有申请者需通过该系统报名申请，否则不予接收报名材料</b>）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>五、申请材料</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span><span><span><span>上海交通大学药学院研究生优才夏令营活动申请表<b>（点击下载：</b></span></span></span><span><a href=\"https://pharm.sjtu.edu.cn/upload/file/20210531/20210531145935.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><b><span><span><span>上海交通大学药学院研究生优才夏令营申请表</span></span></span></b></a></span><b><span><span><span>；打印后需签字盖章扫描上传）</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span><span><span><span>居民二代身份证（正反面扫描件）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>3.</span></span></span><span><span><span>学生证（扫描件）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>4.</span></span></span><span><span><span>教育部学籍在线验证报告（登录学信网：</span></span></span><span><a href=\"http://www.chsi.com.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>http://www.chsi.com.cn/</span></span></span></a></span><span><span><span>进入“学信档案”在线申请学籍验证）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>5.</span></span></span><span><span><span>本科阶段成绩单并加盖所在学校或学院教务部门公章，成绩单上应标明专业排名，若排名证明单独开具，请加盖学校或学院公章（扫描件）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>6.</span></span></span><span><span><span>外语水平证明材料（如英语六级、托福、雅思等成绩单原件扫描件）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>7.</span></span></span><span><span><span>个人简历</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>8.</span></span></span><span><span><span>其他材料（如已发表的论文或专利、与科研相关的获奖证书等原件扫描件，请合并成一个PDF文件上传，非必须项）</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>9.</span></span></span><span><span><span>博士阶段研究计划书（仅申请推免直博生需填写）</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>注： </span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>1. </span></span></span></b><b><span><span><span>关于系统上传材料的限制：身份证明，英语证明，成绩单等单一材料大小不超过5MB；发表论文或者获奖证明建议参加夏令营时自主携带纸质版，如的确有上传到系统的必要性，请限制在10-15MB。</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><b><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></b> <b><span><span><span>关于系统中本科期间发表论文、获奖情况栏目的填报：原则上仅限学生本科阶段在核心期刊上以独立作者或第一作者发表的与学业相关的科研论文；作为主力成员参加与学业相关的国内权威科研竞赛(全国赛)并获得三等奖以上奖励；学生与直系亲属或学历、职称、职务明显高于本人者合作的科研成果、竞赛奖项等仅作为参考，不纳入学生本人推免遴选综合评价成绩计算体系，同等条件下可优先考虑。</span></span></span></b></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>六、资格审查</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  报名截止后，我院将根据申请者材料进行入围资格审查，以申请者的教育背景、学业水平、科研能力、综合素质等为主要评价依据。入围者名单及具体安排将于六月底或七月初在学院网站公布，并发送通知电子邮件。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>七、遴选方式</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  我院将在夏令营期间组织综合考核，主要考察学生的专业基础知识、英语水平、科研潜力及综合能力素质。招生考核小组将根据综合考核情况，评选出“优秀营员”。“优秀营员”名单将于</span></span></span><b><span><span><span>七</span></span></span></b><span><span><span>月底前公示，请关注学院官网后续通知。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>八、“优秀营员”政策</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  如“优秀营员”获得所在学校推荐免试直升研究生资格，并在教育部“全国推荐优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生信息公开暨管理服务系统”（以下简称“推免服务系统”）中选报我院，我院将通过“推免服务系统”向其发送拟录取通知。“优秀营员”联系博士招生导师，双方达成互选后，在“推免服务系统”中按照本科直博生进行报名，则可转为直博生录取。我院根据夏令营综合考核分数从高到低择优录取，额满为止，同等情况下<b>申请直博者优先</b>。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>九、致远荣誉计划博士生</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  我院在2026年继续面向直博生实施博士生“致远荣誉计划”，旨在培养一批具有宽阔视野、科学精神、创新能力与社会责任感的未来科学和工程技术领军人才，推动博士生创新培养体系建设。有意向申报的同学，请关注项目介绍（</span></span></span><span><a href=\"https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/bsszyryjh/xmjs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://www.gs.sjtu.edu.cn/bsszyryjh/xmjs</span></span></a></span><span><span><span>）。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>十、工程硕博士培养改革专项</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  自2022年起，学院启动招收工程硕博士培养改革专项研究生，与国家重点实验室、国家重点企业进行联合培养。学院2026级工程硕博士培养改革专项全部面向推荐免试研究生招生，优先从夏令营“优秀营员”中选拔。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>十一、其它事项</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>  本方案解释权属上海交通大学药学院</span></span></span><span><span><span>，其他条款参照《上海交通大学招收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生实施办法》执行</span></span></span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>十二、联系方式</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span>021-34206120</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span><span><a href=\"mailto:pharmacygrad@sjtu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>pharmacygrad@sjtu.edu.cn</span></span></a></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>联系人：傅老师</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>如遇到系统问题，请联系上海交通大学研招办：021-62821069</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>上海交通大学药学院</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><span><span>2025</span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n</div>","textSha256":"db3e01082a7c25e006341a4d327e8f739c5226824fa73acecf75483cb0812cc3","textLength":2781,"sourceSha256":"6124f678fda1d8a61a01fc6bc30ebbcfaa71765c713499c615fe7bb367b1d642","selector":".snr","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6c01e64f05fb655cb0fc","title":"2025年上海交通大学药学院2026级研究生优才夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:03:50.235787+00:00"}
